1
00:00:14,723 --> 00:00:18,601
It may be possible to attain heaven.

2
00:00:18,685 --> 00:00:21,354
Can you be more specific?

3
00:00:21,438 --> 00:00:24,816
I've recorded it in a notebook.

4
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,234
However,

5
00:00:26,317 --> 00:00:29,028
before I learned of his methods…

6
00:00:31,489 --> 00:00:34,743
I laid in wait for over two decades

7
00:00:35,326 --> 00:00:37,787
to gain access to Jotaro Kujo's memory.

8
00:00:38,413 --> 00:00:41,416
The contents of the notebook
are within his memory.

9
00:00:41,499 --> 00:00:44,794
The murderer had planned to steal
my father's Stand by giving it form.

10
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:45,837
That's his ability.

11
00:00:46,337 --> 00:00:49,132
My dad's not dead.

12
00:00:49,215 --> 00:00:51,760
If I get his Stand back,
he will come back to life.

13
00:00:54,596 --> 00:00:55,597
I won.

14
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,266
Don't underestimate me, bitch!

15
00:00:58,349 --> 00:01:00,268
Nothing has changed.

16
00:01:00,351 --> 00:01:04,022
Even with Star Platinum,
your father is still a living mummy!

17
00:01:04,606 --> 00:01:07,567
The User has my father's memory disc.

18
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:10,987
Now's my chance to find its User!

19
00:01:15,825 --> 00:01:19,954
There's something I want you
to try doing to it.

20
00:01:20,038 --> 00:01:23,041
Is that a human bone?

21
00:01:23,124 --> 00:01:24,501
Whose is it?

22
00:01:24,584 --> 00:01:26,753
It doesn't concern you.

23
00:01:26,836 --> 00:01:29,964
Let's just say that it belongs to
an old friend of mine.

24
00:01:31,090 --> 00:01:32,926
My dear friend,

25
00:01:33,009 --> 00:01:34,928
Dio's bone.

26
00:03:07,145 --> 00:03:07,979
EPISODE 13: SMACK OF LOVE AND REVENGE (2)

27
00:03:08,062 --> 00:03:09,898
Damn, it got my leg.

28
00:03:09,981 --> 00:03:12,817
Ermes, just what is happening here?

29
00:03:12,901 --> 00:03:15,528
- Is this a Stand attack?
- That's right.

30
00:03:19,073 --> 00:03:21,409
Run! It's charging towards you!

31
00:03:22,285 --> 00:03:24,162
It's already on the move!

32
00:03:24,245 --> 00:03:25,663
Stone Ocean!

33
00:03:36,716 --> 00:03:37,759
Jolyne!

34
00:03:51,231 --> 00:03:52,982
So this is a Stand ability.

35
00:03:53,733 --> 00:03:57,528
He must have gotten a disc
from Pale Snake.

36
00:03:58,029 --> 00:03:59,280
This must mean…

37
00:04:00,114 --> 00:04:01,491
I see now.

38
00:04:01,574 --> 00:04:04,285
Jolyne, take F.F. and get out of here.

39
00:04:04,869 --> 00:04:06,704
This is my problem.

40
00:04:06,788 --> 00:04:08,706
You stay out of it.

41
00:04:09,290 --> 00:04:10,792
No, Ermes.

42
00:04:10,875 --> 00:04:13,336
This isn't just your problem anymore.

43
00:04:14,796 --> 00:04:17,173
Sports Maximum must be after something.

44
00:04:17,882 --> 00:04:21,803
Most likely, it's related to
my father's stolen memory.

45
00:04:21,886 --> 00:04:25,223
He is trying to find something
within these prison walls.

46
00:04:25,848 --> 00:04:28,393
And we can learn what he's plotting

47
00:04:28,476 --> 00:04:31,729
by reading the disc
inside Sports Maximum's head.

48
00:04:31,813 --> 00:04:35,566
Jolyne, focus on
escaping this corridor for now.

49
00:04:36,150 --> 00:04:39,779
He has got to be close
to drowning in that pipe.

50
00:04:39,862 --> 00:04:42,782
If we can hold out until then,
his ability will disappear.

51
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:45,243
- Something's off.
- What?

52
00:04:45,827 --> 00:04:46,828
Where is it?

53
00:04:46,911 --> 00:04:49,205
The invisible stuffed alligator.

54
00:04:50,665 --> 00:04:52,458
If it moves, the threads should vibrate

55
00:04:52,542 --> 00:04:54,210
and show me its location.

56
00:05:03,511 --> 00:05:04,846
It's on the wall!

57
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:07,265
The hell?

58
00:05:07,348 --> 00:05:10,935
Shit, an invisible corpse
has no concept of up and down.

59
00:05:11,019 --> 00:05:13,062
It can travel on the floor or the walls!

60
00:05:13,730 --> 00:05:15,481
Stop!

61
00:05:15,565 --> 00:05:18,693
I'm the one you want, bastard!

62
00:05:18,776 --> 00:05:20,361
You're wrong, Ermes.

63
00:05:20,445 --> 00:05:22,780
He's no longer just an enemy of you two.

64
00:05:23,364 --> 00:05:26,951
This bastard bit off my left leg.

65
00:05:27,869 --> 00:05:29,454
Where is my leg now?

66
00:05:29,537 --> 00:05:30,913
In its stomach?

67
00:05:31,581 --> 00:05:33,750
So this asshole is my enemy too.

68
00:05:35,084 --> 00:05:36,669
Stay back, F.F.

69
00:05:36,753 --> 00:05:38,254
We don't know where it is.

70
00:05:38,838 --> 00:05:40,048
It'll take a bite out of you!

71
00:05:41,299 --> 00:05:43,426
Stop, F.F.

72
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,096
You're right.

73
00:05:47,180 --> 00:05:48,681
It'll bite me.

74
00:05:48,765 --> 00:05:51,768
That's all these corpses can do.

75
00:05:51,851 --> 00:05:53,770
But it's fine.

76
00:05:53,853 --> 00:05:56,689
I got my hand inside its mouth.

77
00:06:06,074 --> 00:06:07,617
We did it.

78
00:06:08,117 --> 00:06:10,411
I felt it going down.

79
00:06:16,751 --> 00:06:19,587
Isn't this a part of your mauled shoulder?

80
00:06:20,505 --> 00:06:23,299
Dammit, it may not be big enough
to patch up.

81
00:06:23,841 --> 00:06:25,802
He chomped your shoulder to pieces.

82
00:06:25,885 --> 00:06:27,553
Here, F.F.

83
00:06:27,637 --> 00:06:29,680
Oh, thanks.

84
00:06:29,764 --> 00:06:33,059
- Ermes, come closer.
- Yeah?

85
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,529
Ermes, am I correct

86
00:06:44,612 --> 00:06:48,366
that we were attacked by
an alligator-like ghost?

87
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:51,786
Sports Maximum controls these ghosts.

88
00:06:51,869 --> 00:06:53,746
No, I don't think that's right.

89
00:06:54,330 --> 00:06:55,498
It was way too vicious.

90
00:06:55,581 --> 00:06:58,793
It wasn't a ghost,
but an invisible corpse.

91
00:06:58,876 --> 00:06:59,919
What?

92
00:07:00,837 --> 00:07:04,423
A living dead that hunts for blood
by instinct.

93
00:07:04,507 --> 00:07:08,094
Sports Maximum's ability
can create invisible zombies.

94
00:07:09,303 --> 00:07:10,680
The pipe!

95
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:13,141
What is it now, Ermes?

96
00:07:13,683 --> 00:07:15,435
What happened to Sports Maximum?

97
00:07:15,518 --> 00:07:17,228
Did he drown to death?

98
00:07:17,812 --> 00:07:18,980
I can't tell.

99
00:07:19,063 --> 00:07:20,606
It's too dark for me to see.

100
00:07:20,690 --> 00:07:23,025
He may be lodged deeper in the pipe.

101
00:07:23,818 --> 00:07:24,652
Or, maybe he…

102
00:07:25,862 --> 00:07:28,239
These handprints…

103
00:07:36,622 --> 00:07:38,458
Fuck…

104
00:07:39,083 --> 00:07:41,752
My throat is coated with shitty water.

105
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:44,422
I want to rinse my mouth, dammit.

106
00:07:44,505 --> 00:07:47,425
What was I about to do?

107
00:07:47,508 --> 00:07:49,802
Where was I trying to go?

108
00:07:50,803 --> 00:07:53,264
Oh, I remember it now.

109
00:07:53,347 --> 00:07:54,640
The chapel…

110
00:07:55,224 --> 00:07:56,726
I'm headed to the chapel.

111
00:07:58,436 --> 00:08:00,313
My mission…

112
00:08:00,396 --> 00:08:03,065
is to find that piece of bone.

113
00:08:03,649 --> 00:08:06,944
If you fail, surely you understand

114
00:08:07,028 --> 00:08:11,157
that the ability I bestowed
will no longer be yours.

115
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,366
I know it.

116
00:08:12,450 --> 00:08:16,454
My ability, Limp Viscuit,
can find that bone.

117
00:08:16,537 --> 00:08:19,665
The bone Pale Snake ordered me to find.

118
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:21,751
I can find it.

119
00:08:22,502 --> 00:08:24,295
Dammit.

120
00:08:24,378 --> 00:08:27,215
I sure could use a break before I start.

121
00:08:27,882 --> 00:08:31,385
Like a good scrubbing
and something to drink.

122
00:08:31,469 --> 00:08:33,804
Something refreshing.

123
00:08:37,642 --> 00:08:39,393
That woman there…

124
00:08:39,477 --> 00:08:40,895
Perfect timing.

125
00:08:40,978 --> 00:08:45,024
She's a bitch type… What was her name?

126
00:08:45,107 --> 00:08:46,817
I can't recall it.

127
00:08:47,318 --> 00:08:48,611
I'll just call her a bitch.

128
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:53,324
Damn.

129
00:08:53,407 --> 00:08:56,494
Won't even greet me
though I'm bribing him.

130
00:08:57,453 --> 00:08:59,997
Hey, how's it going?

131
00:09:00,081 --> 00:09:01,332
Are you on duty?

132
00:09:01,916 --> 00:09:04,252
I could use a drink.

133
00:09:04,335 --> 00:09:06,420
You want to go to the cafe with me?

134
00:09:06,504 --> 00:09:11,300
Afterward, we can have a little fun
in a corner in some room.

135
00:09:11,884 --> 00:09:14,637
We can rub each other's bodies all over.

136
00:09:18,307 --> 00:09:22,186
Asshole, how dare you touch me?

137
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:25,648
You touched me. You better pay up first!

138
00:09:25,731 --> 00:09:27,441
What are you talking about?

139
00:09:27,525 --> 00:09:28,901
Little shit.

140
00:09:28,985 --> 00:09:32,154
How dare he touch you
when he hasn't even paid?

141
00:09:36,659 --> 00:09:37,743
What the…

142
00:09:38,494 --> 00:09:39,328
Dammit.

143
00:09:39,912 --> 00:09:41,831
Where did Sports Maximum go off to?

144
00:09:42,957 --> 00:09:47,628
He must have escaped that pipe
while we were dealing with the alligator.

145
00:09:48,254 --> 00:09:49,338
Or…

146
00:09:49,422 --> 00:09:53,050
Maybe he has already
turned into an invisible corpse.

147
00:09:53,634 --> 00:09:55,803
That was just a little kick.

148
00:09:55,886 --> 00:09:57,805
Stop fooling around!

149
00:09:57,888 --> 00:09:59,599
Fooling around?

150
00:09:59,682 --> 00:10:02,310
He looks down on you once
and it's over for you, bitch.

151
00:10:02,393 --> 00:10:05,021
Do whatever it takes to make him pay up.

152
00:10:05,104 --> 00:10:07,231
Lend me a hand, and let's find his cash.

153
00:10:08,858 --> 00:10:11,277
Are you listening? Come on, help me.

154
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:14,196
He's got something on his sleeves.

155
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:15,364
What's this?

156
00:10:16,324 --> 00:10:19,035
Oh, so you will pay me?

157
00:10:19,118 --> 00:10:21,162
Why didn't you say that first?

158
00:10:21,245 --> 00:10:24,957
That's what I just said.
Listen closely, idiot.

159
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:31,255
What else can he be hiding?
What about here inside his mouth?

160
00:10:33,758 --> 00:10:37,720
Hold on, you want to do it
right now, right here?

161
00:10:37,803 --> 00:10:39,347
I don't get it.

162
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:41,307
What is it that you want to do?

163
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:44,852
Come on, stop fooling around.

164
00:10:44,935 --> 00:10:48,272
I don't do that kinky stuff.

165
00:10:52,985 --> 00:10:56,864
I'll be taking this.
You had something nice, after all.

166
00:11:06,415 --> 00:11:08,417
What the hell is this?

167
00:11:08,501 --> 00:11:09,543
This isn't a drug.

168
00:11:09,627 --> 00:11:11,629
It's seeping out of my skin.

169
00:11:12,922 --> 00:11:14,548
This smell…

170
00:11:14,632 --> 00:11:15,800
It's sewage!

171
00:11:15,883 --> 00:11:17,301
It's the stench of sewage!

172
00:11:19,428 --> 00:11:20,930
My body…

173
00:11:21,013 --> 00:11:24,475
The filthy water seeping out of
my body reeks of…

174
00:11:25,059 --> 00:11:28,062
Fuck! No, I can't already be…

175
00:11:28,145 --> 00:11:29,355
The hell?

176
00:11:29,438 --> 00:11:32,191
It's flowing from midair.
The fuck's going on?

177
00:11:46,789 --> 00:11:50,543
I didn't want anything to drink
in the first place.

178
00:11:50,626 --> 00:11:52,086
I wanted to devour something!

179
00:11:52,670 --> 00:11:55,923
I wanted to devour
and satisfy this craving!

180
00:11:56,006 --> 00:11:57,258
Yes, the brains!

181
00:11:58,259 --> 00:12:00,136
I remember it now.

182
00:12:00,219 --> 00:12:03,556
I drowned to death in that pipe.

183
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:06,350
Shit! She did this to me!

184
00:12:06,934 --> 00:12:09,770
That younger sister of Gloria Costello!

185
00:12:10,354 --> 00:12:13,149
That bitch, how dare she do this to me?

186
00:12:14,608 --> 00:12:16,235
How dare she!

187
00:12:20,781 --> 00:12:22,074
I thirst!

188
00:12:27,288 --> 00:12:28,706
Ermes, look over there.

189
00:12:28,789 --> 00:12:29,832
Oh, my.

190
00:12:32,168 --> 00:12:34,879
Be careful. He's out of the pipe
just as I thought.

191
00:12:34,962 --> 00:12:36,547
How did he do this to her?

192
00:12:36,630 --> 00:12:39,049
Did he bite her to death?

193
00:12:39,633 --> 00:12:41,719
Are human teeth capable
of such a vicious attack?

194
00:12:41,802 --> 00:12:44,013
Can they destroy a human body like this?

195
00:12:44,096 --> 00:12:48,476
He's no longer human,
neither in intelligence nor morals.

196
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:52,521
But Pale Snake's disc is
with this man, without a doubt.

197
00:12:52,605 --> 00:12:54,982
I'll do whatever it takes
to get that disc.

198
00:12:55,065 --> 00:12:57,693
Jolyne, you wait outside.

199
00:13:02,990 --> 00:13:05,409
Damn, he slipped out.

200
00:13:06,452 --> 00:13:07,786
Don't leave my side, Ermes.

201
00:13:08,412 --> 00:13:09,455
We're trapped in!

202
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:12,166
He is capable of thinking
just like a human!

203
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:14,168
Stay away from the wall!

204
00:13:14,251 --> 00:13:17,796
We already know that
he's not confined to the floor!

205
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:20,633
We'll track his location
three-dimensionally!

206
00:13:22,718 --> 00:13:24,094
There you are!

207
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:28,390
You chose to hang from the ceiling.

208
00:13:28,974 --> 00:13:30,976
Sounds like I crushed some bones.

209
00:13:35,189 --> 00:13:39,527
Grabbing with his broken wrist?
Right, he's already a corpse.

210
00:13:41,445 --> 00:13:42,613
Stone Ocean!

211
00:13:45,658 --> 00:13:46,492
He's caught!

212
00:13:51,288 --> 00:13:52,289
No.

213
00:13:52,873 --> 00:13:53,832
Jolyne!

214
00:13:53,916 --> 00:13:55,918
That's not Sports Maximum!

215
00:13:56,502 --> 00:13:59,713
He's using
the dead woman's body as a decoy!

216
00:14:02,091 --> 00:14:04,385
Jolyne!

217
00:14:09,056 --> 00:14:10,975
STAND NAME: LIMP VISCUIT
STAND MASTER: SPORTS MAXIMUM

218
00:14:12,518 --> 00:14:14,019
Jolyne!

219
00:14:19,692 --> 00:14:22,403
Where? Where the hell are you, fucker?

220
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,656
Jolyne.

221
00:14:25,739 --> 00:14:28,117
Don't move anymore, Jolyne.

222
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,703
He's not your enemy.

223
00:14:30,786 --> 00:14:33,372
This is between me and Sports Maximum.

224
00:14:33,455 --> 00:14:35,374
Like I said, Ermes.

225
00:14:35,457 --> 00:14:36,876
This goes beyond

226
00:14:36,959 --> 00:14:41,297
your personal desire for revenge.

227
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:45,342
No, not even beyond.

228
00:14:45,426 --> 00:14:49,555
We are already out of time
and energy to even plan.

229
00:14:49,638 --> 00:14:50,472
Look over there.

230
00:14:54,852 --> 00:14:56,478
- He can't be…
- He's had us…

231
00:14:57,938 --> 00:15:01,942
cornered the entire time.

232
00:15:02,776 --> 00:15:04,904
He has already revived them.

233
00:15:04,987 --> 00:15:06,906
The invisible undead.

234
00:15:08,407 --> 00:15:10,200
Who knows how many are lurking and where.

235
00:15:10,284 --> 00:15:12,536
We're surrounded, Ermes.

236
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:14,872
Let's turn back for now.

237
00:15:14,955 --> 00:15:16,874
Staying alive is our priority.

238
00:15:16,957 --> 00:15:20,294
We must open that door
so that we can escape.

239
00:15:20,377 --> 00:15:23,547
I'll extend the thread
as much as possible to get F.F.

240
00:15:23,631 --> 00:15:24,798
We'll retreat for now.

241
00:15:24,882 --> 00:15:26,258
Retrieving the disc

242
00:15:26,842 --> 00:15:28,469
and getting your revenge can wait.

243
00:15:32,890 --> 00:15:33,891
Ermes!

244
00:15:34,558 --> 00:15:35,643
Revenge…

245
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:39,480
That's what's important here, Jolyne.

246
00:15:40,481 --> 00:15:43,734
Revenge matters most
even to Sports Maximum,

247
00:15:43,817 --> 00:15:45,861
who is lurking somewhere in this room.

248
00:15:46,445 --> 00:15:49,657
He wants to get revenge for
being drowned to death.

249
00:15:50,157 --> 00:15:53,202
He must be overcome by
vengeance right now.

250
00:15:53,744 --> 00:15:59,083
He wants to maul me to death
and fill his mouth with blood.

251
00:15:59,166 --> 00:16:03,170
- What are you--
- Sports Maximum will make sure

252
00:16:03,253 --> 00:16:05,923
- that he's the one who kills me.
- Ermes.

253
00:16:06,590 --> 00:16:07,967
Listen, Jolyne.

254
00:16:08,050 --> 00:16:12,304
Some people will say getting even
won't bring my sister back.

255
00:16:12,388 --> 00:16:14,974
As if they know what I went through.

256
00:16:15,057 --> 00:16:17,643
And others tell me
forgiveness is important.

257
00:16:18,310 --> 00:16:20,521
Gloria!

258
00:16:21,105 --> 00:16:21,981
Bullshit.

259
00:16:22,564 --> 00:16:25,275
Forcing myself to forget how it feels

260
00:16:25,359 --> 00:16:28,821
to have family thrown
in the gutter and live on?

261
00:16:28,904 --> 00:16:30,948
I refuse to live like that,

262
00:16:31,824 --> 00:16:34,660
and I've braced myself for this moment.

263
00:16:35,536 --> 00:16:41,000
Revenge is the way
to settle the score with my fate.

264
00:16:41,959 --> 00:16:43,460
No, Ermes.

265
00:16:43,544 --> 00:16:45,170
Fighting him to the death?

266
00:16:45,254 --> 00:16:47,464
Stop. Step back, Ermes.

267
00:16:47,548 --> 00:16:49,383
I'm reaching F.F. at this very moment.

268
00:16:49,466 --> 00:16:51,844
Five, no, seven of the undead

269
00:16:51,927 --> 00:16:54,388
are severing my threads
and closing in on us!

270
00:16:55,681 --> 00:16:59,059
Don't do this, Ermes!

271
00:17:03,230 --> 00:17:05,357
Ermes!

272
00:17:06,358 --> 00:17:09,278
Which direction would he strike from?

273
00:17:12,823 --> 00:17:15,451
My… consciousness…

274
00:17:21,749 --> 00:17:23,083
Ermes…

275
00:17:25,461 --> 00:17:28,130
She copied her head with her sticker!

276
00:17:28,213 --> 00:17:29,339
The seal of kiss…

277
00:17:29,423 --> 00:17:31,341
is my license for revenge!

278
00:17:31,425 --> 00:17:35,054
I found you, Sports Maximum!

279
00:17:37,890 --> 00:17:41,101
I knew you'd try as much.

280
00:17:41,185 --> 00:17:44,313
Just like when you trapped me
in that pipe,

281
00:17:44,396 --> 00:17:49,526
I knew you'd use that sticker
to copy an object.

282
00:17:49,610 --> 00:17:52,362
Your ability won't work against
me anymore.

283
00:17:52,446 --> 00:17:54,615
After all, I am…

284
00:17:54,698 --> 00:17:57,701
already dead.

285
00:17:57,785 --> 00:18:00,245
Shit, it didn't work.

286
00:18:00,329 --> 00:18:01,538
Where the hell is he?

287
00:18:01,622 --> 00:18:04,917
You can't hear my voice, can you?

288
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,752
But I'll say it anyway.

289
00:18:06,835 --> 00:18:12,382
It's your sister's fault
for witnessing what she shouldn't have.

290
00:18:14,259 --> 00:18:16,136
Er… mes…

291
00:18:23,268 --> 00:18:24,686
Damn! Missed again!

292
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:26,355
Because of your sister,

293
00:18:26,438 --> 00:18:30,275
I fell into your hands,
and look at me now.

294
00:18:30,359 --> 00:18:33,529
I will never get over this feeling.

295
00:18:33,612 --> 00:18:34,738
Not this one.

296
00:18:34,822 --> 00:18:35,989
Nor this one.

297
00:18:36,073 --> 00:18:37,324
Listen up.

298
00:18:37,407 --> 00:18:41,120
Even if I eat your brains

299
00:18:41,203 --> 00:18:47,459
and stuff the shit in your guts
into your emptied skull,

300
00:18:47,543 --> 00:18:50,629
I will never get over what you did to me.

301
00:18:54,424 --> 00:18:55,551
It's over!

302
00:18:55,634 --> 00:18:58,929
Now, I will finish you off!

303
00:19:02,558 --> 00:19:05,853
Ermes was waiting for this exact moment!

304
00:19:05,936 --> 00:19:10,357
The moment he removes the sticker
so he can maul her head!

305
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:12,025
Remove the sticker,

306
00:19:12,109 --> 00:19:14,027
and the copy fuses back to the original.

307
00:19:14,111 --> 00:19:18,157
Even if Sports Maximum
had swallowed the duplicate earlier!

308
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:21,451
I know exactly where you are now!

309
00:19:21,535 --> 00:19:23,370
Aim slightly above.

310
00:19:23,453 --> 00:19:26,832
The midsagittal plane of your face!

311
00:19:36,049 --> 00:19:37,134
She got him!

312
00:19:37,217 --> 00:19:38,719
Listen.

313
00:19:38,802 --> 00:19:41,388
This kick is for Gloria.

314
00:19:41,471 --> 00:19:44,558
Sounds like the bones on your face
broke just now.

315
00:19:44,641 --> 00:19:47,644
Think of it as Gloria smashing your face.

316
00:19:48,228 --> 00:19:49,438
And this…

317
00:19:49,521 --> 00:19:51,148
is also for Gloria!

318
00:19:52,733 --> 00:19:55,319
Make mincemeat out of this bitch!

319
00:19:58,405 --> 00:20:00,908
You plan on hiding again.

320
00:20:00,991 --> 00:20:02,743
Well, you won't be able to.

321
00:20:02,826 --> 00:20:06,538
A sticker split your head in two.

322
00:20:07,664 --> 00:20:10,542
Remove this sticker,
and it returns to the original.

323
00:20:11,543 --> 00:20:14,588
The next hit is also for Gloria.

324
00:20:17,132 --> 00:20:18,884
And the one after that too.

325
00:20:20,761 --> 00:20:23,138
And so is the next one!

326
00:20:23,222 --> 00:20:25,599
The next one too.

327
00:20:25,682 --> 00:20:27,059
They are all for Gloria!

328
00:20:27,142 --> 00:20:28,518
This one,

329
00:20:29,269 --> 00:20:30,562
and this one too!

330
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:32,481
Take this!

331
00:20:33,482 --> 00:20:35,192
And this!

332
00:20:35,275 --> 00:20:37,361
This, this, and this!

333
00:20:37,444 --> 00:20:39,404
This, this, this, and this!

334
00:20:39,488 --> 00:20:42,616
They're all for Gloria!

335
00:21:11,144 --> 00:21:15,565
I don't know why,
but tears started rolling down.

336
00:21:17,025 --> 00:21:22,281
I just want… to cry next to you.

337
00:21:23,699 --> 00:21:29,162
But I may not have that kind of time.

338
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:33,166
F.F.!

339
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:35,502
Where are you? Come heal her!

340
00:21:35,585 --> 00:21:37,504
Hurry!

341
00:21:37,587 --> 00:21:39,256
Open this door.

342
00:21:39,339 --> 00:21:40,841
Hurry!

343
00:21:40,924 --> 00:21:43,010
SPORTS MAXIMUM
STAND NAME: LIMP VISCUIT - ANNIHILATED

344
00:23:14,267 --> 00:23:15,977
Emergency alarm,

345
00:23:16,061 --> 00:23:18,480
Commons Area 1A, Mausoleum.

346
00:23:18,563 --> 00:23:19,940
Stop right there!

347
00:23:20,023 --> 00:23:21,024
What's going on here?

348
00:23:21,108 --> 00:23:22,901
Don't move!

349
00:23:27,864 --> 00:23:30,826
Prisoner FE40536.

350
00:23:30,909 --> 00:23:33,286
Name, Jolyne Cujoh!

351
00:23:39,167 --> 00:23:41,044
After reading that disc, I now understand.

352
00:23:41,837 --> 00:23:45,215
I know what I must do in here now.

353
00:23:48,093 --> 00:23:48,969
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
